// @test regression/lint-entry-without-exit
// @description ENTRY_WITHOUT_EXIT: a strategy that opens positions and never closes them. strategy.cancel withdraws a PENDING order and must not count as an exit - counting it let a strategy with genuinely unbounded risk pass clean. TV is silent (probed 2026-08-15, see INV144). See INV144.
// @expects parse: success
// @expects warnings: 1
// @expects warning: line=4, message=/never closes them/
//@version=6
strategy("entry without exit")
if close > open
    strategy.entry("long", strategy.long)
if close < open
    strategy.cancel("long")
plot(close)
